# Copy to .dev.vars for local dev (never commit .dev.vars).
# GitHub App "launchwright-app" → Client secrets. Without it, sign-in returns 503.
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=paste-the-client-secret
# Optional: remember which lessons each learner has seen. Same Neon database as the site.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://...
# Optional: encrypts connected accounts (Cloudflare, Neon, Supabase) and pending secrets.
# Must be the SAME value as the platform's TOKEN_KEY. Make one with: openssl rand -base64 32
# TOKEN_KEY=
# Optional: where approval and secret links point (default https://platform.launchwright.app).
# PLATFORM_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8791
# Optional: Supabase OAuth app (refreshes learners' Supabase tokens).
# SUPABASE_CLIENT_ID=
# SUPABASE_CLIENT_SECRET=
